WEBVTT

00:00:30.276 --> 00:00:31.836
And when the schools didn't open

00:00:31.876 --> 00:00:34.276
and they came up
with this idea of hybrid learning,

00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:37.636
you just saw millions of women
being pushed out of the labor force.

00:00:37.676 --> 00:00:43.076
So we lost, you know, again,
decades of progress in nine months.

00:00:43.436 --> 00:00:46.676
And the reason why women
had to leave the workforce

00:00:46.676 --> 00:00:49.636
was because half of our daycare
centers were shut down.

00:00:49.676 --> 00:00:51.796
When you relied on elderly
parents to come in

00:00:51.836 --> 00:00:54.076
and help you with caretaking work,

00:00:54.076 --> 00:00:55.916
they were no longer there or available

00:00:55.956 --> 00:00:58.276
because everyone was terrified
of this pandemic.

00:00:58.556 --> 00:00:59.876
You know, for far too long,

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:03.716
Americans have always paid
more for their childcare